// and wait. One persistent action rather than one pill per item: what a
// finished gather actually gives is rolled from the current zone's own
// pool the moment it resolves, not chosen by the player. Chances within a
// zone are meant to sum to 1; a zone with no pool falls back to the last
// entry rather than ever giving nothing.
