// Foraging XP, first pass -- one flat amount per completed gather, same
// "small flat amount" shape as Farming's WATER_XP. Speed is milestone-based
// rather than the continuous per-level curve Farming/Logging use: nothing
// changes between milestones, then a level unlocks a flat faster time that
// holds until the next one. FORAGE_MS above is the level 0-4 baseline;
// FORAGE_SPEED_LEVELS is checked highest-first and the first level the
